Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.66,0:00:08.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们家猎魔  我们就做这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}My family hunts, it's what we do.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.07,0:00:13.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们开始吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's begin.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.76,0:00:14.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,(走过的路)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.27,0:00:16.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,图妮·贝维尔  记录者  伦敦分会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Toni Bevell, Men of Letters, London chapter house.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.84,0:00:19.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但如果你回答我的问题  你就能走出去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you answer my questions, you'll walk right out that door.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.96,0:00:21.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我被魔鬼本人折磨过\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been tortured by the Devil himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.84,0:00:23.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你能把我怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}What can you do to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.92,0:00:29.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,温家兄弟不比他们控制不了的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Winchesterst are no better than the monsters
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.92,0:00:31.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那些怪物强到哪去\N{\fnArial\fs30}they fail to control.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.05,0:00:32.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们该被铲除\N{\fnArial\fs30}They need to be eliminated.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.58,0:00:35.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们不是一队的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aren't we supposed to be on the same team?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.29,0:00:36.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别碰我儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get away from my boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.53,0:00:37.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mom?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.08,0:00:37.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,‭没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.69,0:00:43.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,毫无疑问  贝维尔夫人太过分了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No argument. Lady Bevell went too far.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.52,0:00:45.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我深表歉意\N{\fnArial\fs30}I deeply apologize.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.08,0:00:47.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们想跟你们合作  我的号码\N{\fnArial\fs30}We wanna work with you. My number.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.14,0:00:48.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我发现了个案子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I found a case.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.06,0:00:50.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果妈妈想猎魔  我们就去\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if Mom wants to hunt, I say we hunt.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.90,0:00:55.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我听说过人死而复生\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've heard of people coming back from the dead before.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.39,0:00:56.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但自己活过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}But to actually do it?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.36,0:00:58.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我有好多空白要填补\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just have a lot of blanks to fill in.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.83,0:00:59.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我得走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.70,0:01:01.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看到温家人不能如愿\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's always nice to see a Winchester
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.18,0:01:02.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,总是很爽的\N{\fnArial\fs30}who can't get what he wants.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.51,0:01:03.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,比莉  她是个死神\N{\fnArial\fs30}Billie. She's a reaper.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.82,0:01:06.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我坚信死了的\N{\fnArial\fs30}See, I'm a big believer in what dies...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.81,0:01:07.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.16,0:01:09.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-不该活过来  -不\N{\fnArial\fs30}- ...stays dead. ‭- No!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.44,0:01:11.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop it! Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.63,0:01:13.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果你们任何一个改主意了\N{\fnArial\fs30}If any of you change your minds,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.50,0:01:14.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们知道我叫什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}you know my name.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.92,0:01:16.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们得把路西法关回笼子里\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've got to put Lucifer back in the cage.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.87,0:01:20.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我认为  我知道路西法最新皮囊是谁了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think I know the identity of Lucifer's newest vessel --
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.78,0:01:21.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,杰夫森·鲁尼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jefferson Rooney,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.95,0:01:24.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,美国总统\N{\fnArial\fs30}President of these United States.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.47,0:01:27.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道你肯定会成为个好父亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just know you'd make an amazing father.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.03,0:01:28.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一个拿非利人要诞生了\N{\fnArial\fs30}A nephilim is come into being.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.51,0:01:30.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就是天使和凡人的后代\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the offspring of an angel and a human.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.42,0:01:31.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,路西法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lucifer.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.81,0:01:35.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你要用那个把路西法从总统身体里赶出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you're gonna pop Lucifer out of the President with that?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.50,0:01:38.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,希望能行  否则我们死定了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hope so. Otherwise, we're all dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.10,0:01:43.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们因企图行刺美国总统\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're under arrest for the attempted assassination
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.21,0:01:45.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,被捕了\N{\fnArial\fs30}of the President of the United States.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.13,0:01:46.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们又不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not like we're in the
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.23,0:01:48.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,做"活到九十  美梦长眠"那行的\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Live till you're 90, die in your sleep" Business.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.47,0:01:49.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,只有一个结局\N{\fnArial\fs30}This only ends one way.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.24,0:01:53.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,(如今)
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.41,0:02:16.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,卡西迪奥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Castiel?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.50,0:02:18.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,玛丽  你在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mary. Where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.60,0:02:20.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我...\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-I, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.32,0:02:23.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,堪萨斯州  劳伦斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lawrence, Kansas.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.65,0:02:26.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,小卡  怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass, what's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.78,0:02:31.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我需要你去地堡见我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I-I need you to meet me at the bunker.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.04,0:02:50.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,六小时前  萨姆和迪恩·温彻斯特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Six hours ago, Sam and Dean Winchester
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.51,0:02:52.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,企图刺杀美国总统\N{\fnArial\fs30}tried to kill the President of the United States.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.64,0:02:55.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,知道为什么吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do we know why?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.72,0:02:57.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们逮捕他们后  他们还一言未发\N{\fnArial\fs30}They haven't said a word since we picked 'em up.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.05,0:03:05.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不说话  好吧  我们对他们有什么了解\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quiet types, okay. What do we know about 'em?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.13,0:03:06.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,了解不少  他们是兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}A lot. Brothers.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.14,0:03:08.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,生于堪萨斯州  劳伦斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Born in Lawrence, Kansas,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.34,0:03:10.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,母亲玛丽·温彻斯特  已死亡\N{\fnArial\fs30}to Mary Winchester, deceased,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.56,0:03:12.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,父亲约翰·温彻斯特  也已死亡\N{\fnArial\fs30}and John Winchester, also deceased.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.99,0:03:15.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,联调局于2007年就开始调查他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}FBI started investigating them back in 2007.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.83,0:03:18.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-为什么  -袭击  杀人\N{\fnArial\fs30}- For what? - Assault, murder,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.67,0:03:21.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,多次损毁尸体\N{\fnArial\fs30}multiple counts of desecrating a corpse.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.47,0:03:22.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,同一具尸体吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}The same corpse?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.20,0:03:27.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不  多具尸体\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Different corpses.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.39,0:03:31.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们2011年登上联调局头号通缉犯榜\N{\fnArial\fs30}They made the FBI's Most Wanted in 2011,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.18,0:03:33.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,然后在爱荷华州安克尼市与警方枪战时死去\N{\fnArial\fs30}then died in a shootout with police in Ankeny, Iowa.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.64,0:03:36.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,至少档案上是这么写的  但显然并非如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}At least that's what their file said, but apparently not.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.13,0:03:38.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,显然是的  那女孩呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Apparently. What about the girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.28,0:03:40.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,凯莉·克莱恩  她是总统助理\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kelly Kline. And she's a Presidential aide,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.55,0:03:41.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但那天之后再没人见过她\N{\fnArial\fs30}but no one's seen her since that day.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.71,0:03:43.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们不清楚她去了哪  或是是否还活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't know where she went or if she's still alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.33,0:03:45.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,多少人知道此事\N{\fnArial\fs30}How many people know about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.97,0:03:47.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们在低调处理\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're keeping it quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.43,0:03:50.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,只有你  我  进行逮捕的特工和总统\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just you, me, the agents who made the arrest, and POTUS.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.00,0:03:51.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但他只记得\N{\fnArial\fs30}But the last thing he remembers...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.90,0:03:54.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,事发前三天晚上做祈祷\N{\fnArial\fs30}was saying his nightly prayers three days before it happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.88,0:03:57.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-被下药了吗  -实验室正在进行毒检\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Drugged? - Lab's running a tox screen now,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.24,0:03:58.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但是可能吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}but yeah, probably.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.79,0:04:00.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,"可能"就是"不确定"\N{\fnArial\fs30}And by "probably," you mean "maybe."
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.94,0:04:03.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,"不确定"就是"我不知道"\N{\fnArial\fs30}And by "maybe," you mean "I don't know."
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.65,0:04:06.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,下次  直说不知道就好\N{\fnArial\fs30}So next time, just say you don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.57,0:04:13.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,听着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.79,0:04:17.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,找你来  是因为你是反恐专家\N{\fnArial\fs30}you're here because you're some big shot anti-terrorism guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.76,0:04:19.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但要我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you want my opinion?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.12,0:04:21.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们应该把那俩疯子带去后面\N{\fnArial\fs30}We should take those two psychos out back.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.48,0:04:24.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我干掉一个  你负责另一个  早点去吃午饭\N{\fnArial\fs30}I cap one, you take the other, we grab an early lunch.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.97,0:04:27.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-是吗  -他们活该\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah? - They got it comin'.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.78,0:04:29.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯  但如果他们不是单独作案呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, but what if they're not working alone?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.44,0:04:33.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果他们还跟...比如\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, what if these boys have ties to...Oh, I don't know,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.06,0:04:36.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,白人民族主义者或穆斯林兄弟会有联系呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}white nationalists, Muslim brotherhood?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.65,0:04:37.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.46,0:04:38.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我就是说说\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just sayin'.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.84,0:04:42.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们或许是什么可怕的冰山的一角呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}They might be the tip of some nasty-ass iceberg.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.76,0:04:45.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-你是这么想的吗  -可能吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That -- that's what you think? - Probably.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.45,0:04:46.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不确定\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.67,0:04:48.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.59,0:04:50.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,去问问看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's find out.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.92,0:04:59.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.07,0:05:01.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}How you doin'?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.13,0:05:05.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,要咖啡吗  或是水\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can I get you coffee? Water?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.78,0:05:07.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你饿了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or you hungry?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.43,0:05:09.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我身上有巧克力棒\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got a chocolate bar here somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.36,0:05:10.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别告诉我妻子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't tell my wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.99,0:05:16.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你今天挺够呛啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}So...you've had a day.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.31,0:05:18.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,想跟我说说吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wanna tell me about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.11,0:05:20.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,比如\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like, for example,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.43,0:05:22.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你为什么要刺杀自由世界的领袖\N{\fnArial\fs30}why you went after the leader of the free world?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.35,0:05:29.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我猜猜  你不喜欢警察\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, let me guess. You don't like cops.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.81,0:05:30.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我理解\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hell, I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.09,0:05:33.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们有时很混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can be real jackasses.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.33,0:05:35.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但你会对我开口的  孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you're gonna talk to me, son.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.80,0:05:37.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just are.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.60,0:05:40.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这不是威胁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now that's not a threat.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.57,0:05:42.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不相信酷刑  那不好使\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't believe in torture. Doesn't work.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.83,0:05:47.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我见过人受水刑  被割伤\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've seen folks waterboarded, cut on.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.38,0:05:50.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们的确会侃侃而谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}And they talk. Ooh, they do.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.20,0:05:53.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但他们绝不会说出你想听的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But they never tell you what you need.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.20,0:05:57.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道什么好使吗  屡试不爽\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what does work, though? Every time?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.04,0:06:00.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,虚无\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.64,0:06:05.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我走后\N{\fnArial\fs30}See, when I leave,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.88,0:06:07.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那扇门就会关闭\N{\fnArial\fs30}that door closes,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.88,0:06:09.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不会再打开\N{\fnArial\fs30}and it stays closed,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.25,0:06:11.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你会被关在黑暗里\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you stay in the dark.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.52,0:06:15.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,听上去可能也没那么糟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now maybe that doesn't sound so bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.70,0:06:21.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但一个月后  一年后\N{\fnArial\fs30}But after a month, a year,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.41,0:06:25.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你盯这几面墙盯得足够久\N{\fnArial\fs30}you spend enough time staring at these walls,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.65,0:06:27.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,只有你  和那一片虚无\N{\fnArial\fs30}just you and all that nothing,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.98,0:06:32.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你会很想开口  好见到个真人\N{\fnArial\fs30}you'll get so crazy to talk, to see someone real,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.12,0:06:35.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你会告诉我我想听的\N{\fnArial\fs30}you'll tell me exactly what I need.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.10,0:06:37.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你会笑着告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll tell me with a smile.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.52,0:06:40.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,只是需要点时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}It'll just take some time.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.23,0:06:45.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,当然了  问题是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course, the thing is,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.49,0:06:47.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你做了那样的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}after what you did,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.48,0:06:50.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不会有人急着让你打电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}no one's in a hurry to get you that phone call.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.31,0:06:52.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你和我\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you and me,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.36,0:06:55.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们有的是时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}we've got all the time in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.07,0:07:16.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,[邪恶力量 第12季第9集]
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.29,0:07:23.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.56,0:07:50.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,(上报  连接已建立  继续)
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.39,0:07:57.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是米克·戴维斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is Mick Davies,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.70,0:08:00.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,提交状态更新报告B3\N{\fnArial\fs30}filing Status Update Bravo Three.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.05,0:08:05.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,按照指示  我一直在尝试打入\N{\fnArial\fs30}As instructed, I've been attempting to make inroads
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.40,0:08:06.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,美国猎人界\N{\fnArial\fs30}with the American hunters.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.56,0:08:09.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但遗憾的是  遭遇了一些挫败\N{\fnArial\fs30}But unfortunately, there's been a few setbacks.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.50,0:08:11.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我来给你描绘一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me paint you a picture
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.56,0:08:15.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一个没有怪物  没有恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}of a world without monsters or demons
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.29,0:08:17.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没有任何晚上出没的讨厌鬼的世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}or any of those little buggers that go bump in the night.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.29,0:08:21.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一个再没有人会因为超自然生灵而死的世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of a world where no one has to die because of the supernatural.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.92,0:08:24.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一个新世界  一个更好的世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of a new world, a better world.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.11,0:08:30.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果你跟我们合作  你将得到支持\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now if you work with us, you'll have support,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.97,0:08:32.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,各种各样的支持\N{\fnArial\fs30}in every sense of the word.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.13,0:08:34.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,需要传说\N{\fnArial\fs30}You need lore?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.35,0:08:36.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们的图书馆是最大最好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our libraries are the biggest and the best.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.45,0:08:38.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你要钱  我们有钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want money? We have money.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.39,0:08:39.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你需要武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}You need weapons?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.28,0:08:42.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们的装备你无法想象\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have gear you can't even imagine.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.49,0:08:45.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的意思是  沃利\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now what I'm saying, Wally,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.77,0:08:49.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你需要我们这样的人  而我们需要你这样的猎人\N{\fnArial\fs30}is that you need people like us, and we need hunters like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.51,0:08:52.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们只求  等我们找到你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now all we ask in return is that when we call,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.48,0:08:54.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你就听命去该去的地方  做该做的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}you go where you're told and you do what you're told.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.06,0:08:56.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是为了大局\N{\fnArial\fs30}For the greater good.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.81,0:09:01.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我看看你的手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me see your hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.93,0:09:04.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,来  给我看看你的手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, let me see your hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.65,0:09:05.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.86,0:09:09.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,挺软\N{\fnArial\fs30}Soft.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.24,0:09:12.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.15,0:09:14.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你猎过魔吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You ever hunt anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.85,0:09:18.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是战术型的  长期策略\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm more tactical. Long-term strategy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.15,0:09:19.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.43,0:09:23.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,听着  迈克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, uh, Mike --
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.87,0:09:25.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-米克  -无所谓\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Mick. - Whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.57,0:09:26.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不认识你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know you,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.08,0:09:29.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我也不想听令于任何人\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I ain't looking to take any orders from anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.82,0:09:31.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,尤其是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Especially some...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.48,0:09:34.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,英国小文员\N{\fnArial\fs30}...limey paper pusher.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.73,0:09:38.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-我想你并不理解  伙计  -我理解\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm not quite sure you understand, mate. - No, I think I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.77,0:09:39.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别介意\N{\fnArial\fs30}So no offense,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.44,0:09:41.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但拿着你的提议\N{\fnArial\fs30}but you can take your offer...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.70,0:09:43.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,然后...\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you can...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.43,0:09:45.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,塞进你菊花里吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}...shove it up your ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.41,0:09:48.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,应该不会太疼\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sure it won't be too painful,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.71,0:09:51.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你手不是挺软嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}what with those soft hands of yours, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.50,0:09:53.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是汉堡的钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's, uh, that's for the burger.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.05,0:10:01.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,简而言之  美国猎人\N{\fnArial\fs30}In short, the American hunters have proven...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.56,0:10:02.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很难搞\N{\fnArial\fs30}difficult.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.13,0:10:04.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,至于温家兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}As for the Winchesters...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.56,0:10:06.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你抛下了他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}You left them.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.43,0:10:08.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不  我...\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.88,0:10:11.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩叫我走的  那女人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean told me to go. The woman --
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.21,0:10:12.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你还弄丢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The one you lost?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.45,0:10:15.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我没有...我以为她...\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't. I... I thought that she --
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.40,0:10:17.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别找借口了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop making excuses!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.09,0:10:28.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果他们需要帮助  为什么不找我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why...if they needed help, why didn't they call me?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.45,0:10:32.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你不在\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were out.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.59,0:10:42.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们怎么会让这种事发生  卡西迪奥\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do we let this happen, Castiel?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.53,0:11:14.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,吃饭了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chow time!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.93,0:11:24.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,吃饭了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chow time!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.93,0:11:36.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,吃饭了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chow time!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.80,0:11:42.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,吃饭了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chow time!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.69,0:11:46.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,吃饭了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chow time!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.64,0:11:51.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,吃饭了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chow time!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.16,0:11:58.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,帮不了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can't help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.04,0:12:01.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,得了  克劳力  警察抓走了他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Crowley. The police took them.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.33,0:12:03.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你在政府里有人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have people in the government.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.17,0:12:05.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-你有间谍  -是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You have spies. - I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.17,0:12:08.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但不管小鹿和松鼠现在怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}But whatever's happened to Moose and Squirrel,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.92,0:12:11.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,显然  他们没有权限打探\N{\fnArial\fs30}apparently, it's above their pay grade.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.75,0:12:14.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你在乎他们被抓吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you even care that they're gone?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.39,0:12:17.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.33,0:12:20.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,知道有多少厉害的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you know how many all-powerful beings
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.14,0:12:21.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,曾试图杀他们吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}have tried to kill them?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.78,0:12:24.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-大概知道  -我也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Roughly, yes. - As do I.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.65,0:12:26.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我也曾是其中之一\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was bloody one of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.32,0:12:29.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但萨姆和迪恩  他们就像疱疹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam and Dean? They're like herpes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.33,0:12:30.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你还以为已经摆脱了他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just when you think they're gone...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.83,0:12:32.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哎呦  他们又回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello! The boys are back,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.54,0:12:34.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,身后还留下一堆尸体\N{\fnArial\fs30}leaving a trail of bodies in their wake.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.61,0:12:38.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不管他们在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}So wherever they are,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.36,0:12:40.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不管是谁抓了萨姆和迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}whoever has Sam and Dean,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.14,0:12:41.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这么说吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.24,0:12:46.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,套用劳伦斯·图拉德(摔跤手)的名句\N{\fnArial\fs30}in the immortal words of Lawrence Tureaud...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.22,0:12:48.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,"我可怜那傻瓜"\N{\fnArial\fs30}"I pity the fool."
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.92,0:13:32.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.18,0:13:35.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.44,0:13:37.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他...\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.69,0:13:39.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-玛丽  -嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Mary? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.13,0:13:42.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是艾莉西娅  阿沙的孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is Alicia. Uh, Asa's kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.53,0:13:45.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,听着  我和我哥哥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I -- me and my brother,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.23,0:13:47.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们在路易斯安那州办个案子\N{\fnArial\fs30}we're working this case in Louisiana.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.97,0:13:50.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们以为是个南方狼人什么的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We thought it was some southern fried werewolf thing,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.78,0:13:52.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但是不止一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}but it's not one thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.88,0:13:54.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是一群\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a pack.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.30,0:13:56.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这里有好多这怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's, like, a billion of them down here,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.02,0:13:58.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们需要帮助\N{\fnArial\fs30}and...we need help.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.65,0:14:02.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.35,0:14:53.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你来见我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks for meeting me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.01,0:15:00.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我只想说  对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just wanted to say... I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.34,0:15:02.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我当时很生气\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was angry, and...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.34,0:15:05.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆和迪恩  那不怪你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam and Dean, that's not your fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.33,0:15:06.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不  你是对的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you were right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.91,0:15:08.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不该抛下他们的  我...\N{\fnArial\fs30}I should never have left them. I...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.16,0:15:13.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,听到什么动静了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you heard anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.17,0:15:20.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我在执法机关的熟人不是退休  就是死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All my law enforcement contacts are retired or...dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.75,0:15:25.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我在努力  但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm trying, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.43,0:15:28.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}You?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.57,0:15:34.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我一直安慰自己  他们没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I keep telling myself they're fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.73,0:15:38.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-他们才不见了  -六周两天10小时\N{\fnArial\fs30}- They've only been gone - 6 weeks, 2 days, and 10 hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.64,0:15:44.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们会找到他们的  卡西迪奥\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll find them, Castiel.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.24,0:15:46.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We will.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.54,0:15:48.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,在那之前  我们...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Until then, we just...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.46,0:15:52.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们在尽力了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're doin' our best.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.02,0:15:54.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are we?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.47,0:15:59.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,听说密苏里州兰开斯特的杀人案了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you hear about the murders in Lancaster, Missouri?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.68,0:16:01.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.76,0:16:03.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好几个女人被撕烂喉咙\N{\fnArial\fs30}The women with their throats ripped out,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.65,0:16:04.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,血被吸干\N{\fnArial\fs30}the blood drained?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.95,0:16:08.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,吸血鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Vampires.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.58,0:16:11.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我在新闻上看到  就想\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saw it on the news and I thought,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.02,0:16:14.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆和迪恩就会去调查这样的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}that's the sort of thing Sam and Dean would investigate.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.05,0:16:16.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们会赶过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}They would roll into town,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.50,0:16:19.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,拯救大局  杀掉怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}save the day, kill the monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.27,0:16:22.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但是他们走后\N{\fnArial\fs30}But with them gone...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.28,0:16:25.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我努力去查案  我努力了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I tried to work the case. I tried.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.49,0:16:28.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但我不知道我哪里做错了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But...I don't know what I did wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.81,0:16:31.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我问问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}I...I asked questions,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.22,0:16:33.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但或许问的人不对\N{\fnArial\fs30}but maybe they were the wrong people
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.24,0:16:34.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,或是问的不对\N{\fnArial\fs30}or the wrong questions,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.30,0:16:37.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我就是找不到它\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I just -- I never found it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.72,0:16:41.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没找到那怪物  根本没沾边\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never found the monster. Never even got close.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.67,0:16:46.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我走前又有三个女人被杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}And three more women died before I left town.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.80,0:16:51.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我逃跑了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Before I ran away.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.74,0:16:58.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那我们回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}So we go back.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.04,0:16:59.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你和我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You and me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.37,0:17:02.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.38,0:17:06.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不  我只会碍事\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I'd only get in your way.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.93,0:17:13.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,吃饭了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chow time!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.63,0:17:16.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,吃饭了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yo, eat up.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.70,0:17:24.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.38,0:17:27.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.99,0:17:30.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我在巡视  我做了心肺复苏\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was doing my rounds and I did CPR,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.51,0:17:31.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但他已经死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}but he was gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.36,0:17:40.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,开另一间牢房  快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get that other cell open. Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.85,0:17:50.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.97,0:18:09.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不懂\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\*}I don't get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.87,0:18:11.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们死在同一天\N{\fnArial\fs30}They both died on the same day?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.84,0:18:12.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这不...\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.83,0:18:16.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这怎么可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}How's that even possible?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.31,0:18:17.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你来说啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}You tell us.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.22,0:18:19.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.02,0:18:22.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这俩月来  我们什么都没做\N{\fnArial\fs30}For the last two months, we've done nothing
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.47,0:18:23.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就干坐着玩蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}but sit around with our junk in our hands
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.99,0:18:26.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就因为你想干耗着\N{\fnArial\fs30}because you wanted to wait them out.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.66,0:18:27.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真是成功\N{\fnArial\fs30}That really worked.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.38,0:18:30.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-干得好  -那我...\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah, nice job. - Well, I'm just gonna...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.40,0:18:32.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.53,0:18:36.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你不是希望他们死吗  他们死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wanted them dead. They're dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.87,0:18:38.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我希望他们得到惩罚\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wanted them punished.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.26,0:18:40.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我想看着迪恩·温彻斯特的眼睛\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wanted to look Dean Winchester in the eye and...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.73,0:18:44.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,让他感觉到痛苦\N{\fnArial\fs30}...wanted him to feel it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.52,0:18:45.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.37,0:18:49.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真是完全不算心理有问题呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}that is totally mentally normal.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.03,0:18:50.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,去死吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go to hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.56,0:19:13.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,(语音信箱)
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.94,0:19:15.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,卡西迪奥  是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Castiel, it's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.42,0:19:17.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我就是打来...\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just calling to...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.58,0:19:21.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你不用担心密苏里州那个怪物了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't have to worry about that thing in Missouri.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.52,0:19:23.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我在处理了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm handling it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.59,0:19:48.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You good?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.94,0:19:53.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯  不算很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I've been better.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.23,0:19:56.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-但我经历过更糟的  -看来成功了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I've been worse. - Looks like it worked.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.42,0:19:58.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,到目前为止是\N{\fnArial\fs30}So far.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.14,0:20:10.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么...\N{\fnArial\fs30}H-how...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.98,0:20:13.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-我们在哪  -我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where are we? - I-I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.03,0:20:13.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,回答他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Answer him.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.93,0:20:16.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真的  他们每天蒙着我的眼睛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seriously, they blindfold me every day
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.05,0:20:18.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,带我来上班的\N{\fnArial\fs30}before they bring me to work.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.96,0:20:19.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我...\N{\fnArial\fs30}I...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.70,0:20:23.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这地方  严格说是不存在的\N{\fnArial\fs30}This place, it's not supposed to exist.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.84,0:20:31.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,(禁区  闲人止步)
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.23,0:20:31.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.29,0:20:52.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这里是我的语音信箱\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is my voicemail.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.54,0:20:53.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,开这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, should we take it?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.42,0:20:54.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,留下你声音的邮件\N{\fnArial\fs30}Make your voice a mail.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.61,0:20:56.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别  大概是有追踪器的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, it's probably got lowjack.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.37,0:21:00.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这里是我的语音信箱\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is my voicemail.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.32,0:21:02.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-拜托  小卡  -找到地图了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Come on, Cass. - Got a map.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.78,0:21:11.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-干什么  -小卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - Cass.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.97,0:21:12.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.11,0:21:14.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哥们  好久不见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, buddy. Long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.04,0:21:16.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么...\N{\fnArial\fs30}What...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.65,0:21:18.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么回事  你在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened? Where -- where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.55,0:21:20.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你不会相信的  而且我也不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wouldn't believe me, and I have no clue.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.93,0:21:22.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有发现\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got something.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.10,0:21:24.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  看来那是麋鹿山\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, looks like that's Elk Mountain,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.14,0:21:27.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那么那就是朗斯峰\N{\fnArial\fs30}which makes that Longs Peak.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.53,0:21:29.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  看来我们在科罗拉多州\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, looks like we're in Colorado.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.73,0:21:31.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,在落基山国家公园\N{\fnArial\fs30}In Rocky Mountain National Park.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.47,0:21:33.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,往北走  应该能走到34号国道\N{\fnArial\fs30}if we head north, we should hit State Route 34.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.99,0:21:35.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-最终会到的  -听到了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Eventually. - Did you get that?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.40,0:21:37.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-嗯  -那好  那里碰头\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yes. - All right, meet us there.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.06,0:21:39.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等等  那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait. Where?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.71,0:21:42.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,沿路开  你会看到我们的  小卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just drive along the road, and you'll see us. And, Cass...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.87,0:21:44.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,越快越好  我们时间不多\N{\fnArial\fs30}the sooner the better. We're kinda on the clock here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.25,0:21:46.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等等  那是什么...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, what does that...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.95,0:21:51.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-你没告诉他  -没\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You didn't tell him? - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.42,0:21:53.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-他们能追踪手机  -对哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}- They'll track the phone. - Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.28,0:22:20.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,卡西迪奥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Castiel?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.21,0:22:24.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,慢点说  什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Slow...slow down. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.92,0:22:29.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,天呐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, God.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.19,0:22:37.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,搞什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}The hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.73,0:23:04.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-下车  -这不是...\N{\fnArial\fs30}- There you go. - This isn't...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.83,0:23:07.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我把过他的脉  他们死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I took his pulse. They were dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.23,0:23:10.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我也不清楚是怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I got no idea what went down here.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.10,0:23:12.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,或许他们买通了哪个守卫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe they got to one of the guards.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.91,0:23:16.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,或许这是什么放慢心跳的功夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe this is some slow your heartbeat kung fu crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.38,0:23:20.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我只知道  温家兄弟现在在逃\N{\fnArial\fs30}What I do know -- the Winchesters are out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.33,0:23:24.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这次  我们按我的办法来\N{\fnArial\fs30}And this time, we're doing it my way.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.21,0:23:26.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.34,0:23:29.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,两名逃犯  已逃跑约45分钟\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got two runners with about a 45-minute head start.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.88,0:23:31.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们是杀人犯\N{\fnArial\fs30}These are killers.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.37,0:23:35.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看到他们  立刻击毙\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you get eyes, you pull the trigger.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.28,0:23:39.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,出发\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's move out.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.18,0:24:00.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你赶到得好快\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\*}You got here quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.69,0:24:01.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.10,0:24:10.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你觉得会是什么样的情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you think we're walking into?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.39,0:24:12.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.12,0:24:14.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们可能需要后援\N{\fnArial\fs30}We may want backup.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.31,0:24:16.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,克劳力和罗威娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crowley and Rowena?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.34,0:24:19.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,地狱之王和他的女巫妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}The King of Hell and his mother, the witch?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.59,0:24:22.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,希望我们能找到更好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hope we can do better than that.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.41,0:24:27.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-我可能有办法了  -好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I may have an idea. - Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.86,0:24:28.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,系好安全带\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seat belt on.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.44,0:24:30.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我开车很快\N{\fnArial\fs30}I drive fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.57,0:24:52.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很久没出外勤了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Long time since you've been in the field, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.96,0:24:54.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果你想回去...\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, if you need to head back...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.66,0:24:56.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.31,0:25:07.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  还有...一小时天黑吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, so we got what? An hour till dark?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.94,0:25:10.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那么还有六小时到午夜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which puts us at six hours till midnight?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.43,0:25:11.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,差不多\N{\fnArial\fs30}That sounds about right.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.42,0:25:13.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩  我们得谈谈这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, we gotta talk about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.66,0:25:15.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  我们会谈的  好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, we will. All right?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.14,0:25:17.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,回头的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Later.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.22,0:25:33.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这就是你的主意\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is your idea?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.44,0:25:36.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们差点杀了我儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}The people that almost killed my boys,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.98,0:25:38.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就找他们做后援\N{\fnArial\fs30}they're gonna be our backup?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.88,0:25:41.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那个恶魔和他妈妈突然看上去不那么糟了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Suddenly, the demon and his mommy don't look so bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.63,0:25:43.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们在路西法的事上帮过我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}They helped us with Lucifer.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.55,0:25:45.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,路西法  魔鬼路西法吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lucifer? The Lucifer?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.91,0:25:47.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-是的  -等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yes. - Wait, so
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.91,0:25:50.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是说  印第安那波利斯的事是\N{\fnArial\fs30}you're telling me what happened in Indianapolis was
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.27,0:25:52.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们去单挑魔鬼本人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}you took on the bleedin' Devil himself?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.68,0:25:53.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.54,0:25:54.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们赢了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you win?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.06,0:25:56.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.38,0:26:00.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,厉害\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bravo.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.66,0:26:03.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但是萨姆和迪恩被抓了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But Sam and Dean were taken.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.30,0:26:06.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们认为我们能救他们回来  但我们需要\N{\fnArial\fs30}We think we can get them back, but we need...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.93,0:26:08.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,帮助\N{\fnArial\fs30}help.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.84,0:26:10.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那我们就帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}So we'll help.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.46,0:26:13.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是吗  这么简单\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really? Just like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.35,0:26:16.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,温彻斯特太太  玛丽\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mrs. Winchester -- Mary...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.33,0:26:20.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我来这国家就一个目的  交朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}I came to this country to do one thing -- make friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.19,0:26:23.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但你们这些美国猎人\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you American hunters, you're --
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.05,0:26:25.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,跟我们不是一路人\N{\fnArial\fs30}you're a different breed than our sort.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.58,0:26:27.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们乖戾  多疑\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're surly, suspicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.45,0:26:30.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-你们不喜欢跟人合作  -这描述很准确\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You don't play well with others. - Well, that is accurate.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.40,0:26:34.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们不信任不熟悉的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't trust people you don't know,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.50,0:26:36.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哪怕他们带着礼物而来\N{\fnArial\fs30}even when they come bearing gifts.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.01,0:26:40.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这我没办法  但我能帮你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now I can't help that, but I can help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.32,0:26:43.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果消息传开  说我们帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if word were to get out that we did our part
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.85,0:26:46.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,救了萨姆和迪恩·温彻斯特  那么\N{\fnArial\fs30}to save Sam and Dean Winchester, well,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.92,0:26:48.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,也对我们有好处  是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}that's just good business, innit?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.49,0:26:50.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谁知道呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And who knows.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.76,0:26:52.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等这一切结束  我们或许还能成为朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}When all this is over, we might even be friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.26,0:27:00.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们认为萨姆和迪恩被关押在\N{\fnArial\fs30}We think Sam and Dean were being held somewhere
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.83,0:27:02.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,落基山国家公园的什么地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}in the Rocky Mountain National Forest.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.96,0:27:04.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,94号地点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Site 94?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.48,0:27:07.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是一处私下的政府设施\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a government facility, off-books.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.78,0:27:09.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,影子行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shadow ops.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.20,0:27:12.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那种官方上讲不存在的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}One of those places that officially doesn't exist.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.83,0:27:15.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那你们怎么知道的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then how do you know about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.19,0:27:18.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们收集情报  这是我们的工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}We gather information. It's our job.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.24,0:27:21.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们叫我们去34号国道跟他们碰面\N{\fnArial\fs30}They told us to meet them off State Route 34.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.34,0:27:24.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那可是挺长一段路  具体在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that's a long stretch of road. Where, exactly?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.05,0:27:26.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不确定\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.43,0:27:28.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我会叫我们技术员调出那一带的卫星图像\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll our techs to put a satellite over the area.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.91,0:27:30.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你还有这本事\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.90,0:27:32.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还不止\N{\fnArial\fs30}And so much more.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.39,0:27:42.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道我们会遭遇怎样的麻烦吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you have any idea what sort of trouble we're walking into?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.55,0:27:43.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.43,0:27:45.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, good.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.81,0:27:47.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我就喜欢惊喜\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do like a surprise.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.23,0:28:25.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-他们追上来了  -嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- They're on us. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.95,0:28:27.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.55,0:28:45.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,诺顿  回话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Norton, come in.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.57,0:28:50.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这里是诺顿  我在...\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is Norton. I'm on the ri--
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.39,0:28:57.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,诺顿  诺顿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Norton? Norton?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.25,0:28:59.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是桑切斯  收到吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is Sanchez. Do you copy?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.99,0:29:03.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,诺顿睡着了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Norton has gone night-night.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.02,0:29:06.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,温彻斯特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Winchester.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.24,0:29:08.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-你是负责人吗  -对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- This the man in charge? - That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.99,0:29:10.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我告诉你接下来会怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, let me tell you how this is gonna go.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.96,0:29:13.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你要召集你的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna call your boys
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.94,0:29:17.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,调头回去  没有人会受伤\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you're gonna turn around, and nobody's gonna get hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.40,0:29:20.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不  接下来会这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no. Here's how this is gonna go.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.88,0:29:23.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我带着我训练有素的士兵\N{\fnArial\fs30}I take my highly trained soldiers,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.22,0:29:26.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,找到你们  你们会受伤\N{\fnArial\fs30}track your ass down, and you get hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.37,0:29:27.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,伤得很重\N{\fnArial\fs30}A lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.22,0:29:30.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们没法一直跑下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't run forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.34,0:29:32.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们困在这里了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're trapped out here.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.71,0:29:38.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看来我们沟通不畅\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, what we have here is a failure to communicate.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.76,0:29:42.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不是我们跟你们困在了这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}'Cause we're not trapped out here with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.68,0:29:45.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是你们跟我们困在了这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're trapped out here with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.14,0:30:04.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这个就行\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\*}That'll work.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.44,0:31:10.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,(急救箱)
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.77,0:32:21.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.23,0:33:01.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你不会有事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll live.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.79,0:33:14.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我说过  是你们被困住了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told you. You're trapped.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.29,0:33:18.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,凯普  开枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Camp. Shoot him!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.47,0:33:24.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.98,0:33:27.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,枪给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hand me the gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.49,0:33:31.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,想听真话吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want the truth?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.89,0:33:36.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,总统被魔鬼附身了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The President was possessed by the Devil.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.63,0:33:37.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们救了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}We saved his life.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.51,0:33:40.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这就是真相\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.72,0:33:44.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道了  你想怎么办都行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now you can take that and do what you want with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.53,0:33:46.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但你敢来追我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}But if you come after us,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.07,0:33:49.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道会怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}you know what'll happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.07,0:34:01.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.27,0:34:04.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们是拯救世界的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're the guys that save that world.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.65,0:34:16.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\*}Sam! Dean!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.37,0:34:18.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-小卡  -小卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Cass. - Cass.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.23,0:34:23.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.43,0:34:25.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.83,0:34:43.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,妈妈  你们怎么找到我们的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mom, how did y'all even find us?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.61,0:34:45.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们帮了忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}They helped.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.58,0:34:47.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, lads.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.17,0:34:52.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们有热成像卫星  看到了你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}They have a thermal imaging satellite that saw you.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.22,0:34:54.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,从太空看到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}From space.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.89,0:34:57.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们没有卫星\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't have one.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.03,0:34:59.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,只是借了一个用了一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just borrowed it for a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.53,0:35:01.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有说得上话的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Friends in all the right places.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.40,0:35:04.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那么我们现在应该说谢谢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I guess this is where we're supposed to say thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.82,0:35:06.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不必  很高兴能帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}No need. Happy to be of service.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.72,0:35:07.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,再次帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Again.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.57,0:35:11.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.48,0:35:13.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们该走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We should get.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.43,0:35:15.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们丢下的人  他们随时会呼叫支援\N{\fnArial\fs30}The people we left, they'll call for backup any second.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.45,0:35:19.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们留活口了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You left survivors?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.21,0:35:24.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们是士兵  只是在尽职\N{\fnArial\fs30}They were soldiers, just doing what they were told.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.90,0:35:28.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但还是有点...不专业\N{\fnArial\fs30}Still...A bit unprofessional.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.15,0:35:30.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们能应付\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll handle it.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.62,0:35:32.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's get.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.03,0:36:01.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等等  你在猎魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}So wait, you're hunting?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.64,0:36:03.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就一点点\N{\fnArial\fs30}A little bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.90,0:36:06.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我就知道你放不下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I knew you couldn't stay away.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.65,0:36:16.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,时候到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's time.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.70,0:36:37.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.12,0:36:39.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.39,0:36:42.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}'Sup?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.52,0:36:51.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,比莉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Billie?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.81,0:36:52.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那个死神\N{\fnArial\fs30}The reaper?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.62,0:36:55.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不懂\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.36,0:37:01.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,妈妈  那地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mom...that place...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.25,0:37:04.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,只有一个办法能逃出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's only one way we were getting out of there,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.78,0:37:06.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,活着是做不到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}and that wasn't breathing.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.20,0:37:12.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以我叫了她\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I made a call.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.20,0:37:17.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,比莉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Billie.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.28,0:37:26.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩跟她谈了  然后比莉来见了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean talked with her, and then Billie came to see me.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.89,0:37:29.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们做了个交易\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we made a deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.52,0:37:32.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们可以再死而复生一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'd get to die and come back one more time,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.92,0:37:35.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但作为交换\N{\fnArial\fs30}but in exchange...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.29,0:37:38.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,午夜  要有一个温彻斯特道别\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come midnight, a Winchester goes bye-bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.11,0:37:40.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,道永别\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like, permanently.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.25,0:37:43.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.68,0:37:47.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我可期待很久了\N{\fnArial\fs30}is something I've been looking forward to for a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.63,0:37:50.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-你为什么  -我们已经死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Why would you - We were already dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.11,0:37:56.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,关在那牢房里  什么都没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Being locked in that cell with nothing...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.52,0:37:58.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我去过地狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been to Hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.58,0:38:01.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这比那还糟\N{\fnArial\fs30}This was worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.29,0:38:06.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,至少这样  我们中还有一个能继续下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}At least this way, one of us gets to keep fighting.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.87,0:38:08.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们不非得这么做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't have to do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.61,0:38:09.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就是非得\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, they do.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.45,0:38:13.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们约定好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We made a pact.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.52,0:38:19.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,血盟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bound in blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.08,0:38:32.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,打破誓言\N{\fnArial\fs30}You break that,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.04,0:38:37.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,会有很严重的后果\N{\fnArial\fs30}there's consequences on a cosmic scale.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.29,0:38:38.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谁来呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}So who's it gonna be?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:44.59,0:38:45.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.84,0:38:47.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-妈妈  不  -妈妈  不\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Mom. No. - Mom. No. No.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.70,0:38:51.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你说午夜时  要死一个温彻斯特\N{\fnArial\fs30}You said come midnight, a Winchester dies?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.89,0:38:55.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我也是温彻斯特\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a Winchester.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.78,0:38:57.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我可以接受\N{\fnArial\fs30}Works for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.03,0:39:00.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-妈妈  -不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Mom! - Don't!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.81,0:39:06.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我爱你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.97,0:39:26.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,小卡  你做了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass, what have you done?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.11,0:39:29.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,必须做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}What had to be done.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.20,0:39:34.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这个世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know this world,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.26,0:39:37.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这个可悲  在劫难逃的小世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}this sad, doomed little world,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.38,0:39:39.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,它需要你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}it needs you.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.66,0:39:44.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,它需要每一个温家人\N{\fnArial\fs30}It needs every last Winchester it can get,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.66,0:39:45.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不会让你们死的\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I will not let you die.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.89,0:39:48.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不会让你们任何人死\N{\fnArial\fs30}I won't let any of you die.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.40,0:39:53.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不会让你们牺牲自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I won't let you sacrifice yourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:53.65,0:39:55.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们对我太重要了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mean too much to me,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.37,0:39:58.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们太重要了\N{\fnArial\fs30}to everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.36,0:40:07.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  你们做了个交易\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, you made a deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.70,0:40:12.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一个愚蠢的交易  而我违约了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You made a stupid deal, and I broke it.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.88,0:40:18.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不客气\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.30,0:40:30.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就这样  温家兄弟又回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And just like that, the Winchesters are back,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.28,0:40:31.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不管怎样\N{\fnArial\fs30}for better or worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.06,0:40:34.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没错  他们没有把一切都收拾干净  但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}True, they did leave loose ends, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:37.48,0:40:39.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那就是凯奇先生的工作嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}that's what Mr. Ketch is for.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.11,0:40:55.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所有知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every person who knew about
Dialogue: 0,0:40:55.06,0:40:57.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆和迪恩的刺杀小历险的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam and Dean's little adventure in assassination
Dialogue: 0,0:40:57.68,0:40:59.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,都已经处理好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}has been dealt with.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:00.74,0:41:01.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就这世界看来\N{\fnArial\fs30}As far as the world's concerned,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:01.84,0:41:03.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这事根本没发生过\N{\fnArial\fs30}it never even happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:03.83,0:41:06.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们可不需要美国政府\N{\fnArial\fs30}The last thing we need is for the United States government
Dialogue: 0,0:41:06.22,0:41:08.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,到处打探  问问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}sniffing about, asking questions.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.58,0:41:13.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,至于打入美国猎人界的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}And as for making inroads with the American hunters,well,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:13.71,0:41:14.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有好消息\N{\fnArial\fs30}good news.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:17.40,0:41:19.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我来给你描绘一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me paint you a picture
Dialogue: 0,0:41:19.39,0:41:22.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一个没有怪物  没有恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}of a world without monsters or demons
Dialogue: 0,0:41:22.27,0:41:24.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没有任何晚上出没的讨厌鬼的世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}or any of those little buggers that go bump in the night.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:26.00,0:41:29.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一个再没有人会因为超自然生灵而死的世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of a world where no one has to die because of the supernatural.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:29.84,0:41:32.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一个新世界  一个更好的世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of a new world, a better world.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:44.47,0:41:45.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,继续说\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm listening.

